ing\\n- Implement request queuing\\n- Provide graceful degradation\\n\\n## Next Steps\\n1. Design validation framework\\n2. Implement logging infrastructure\\n3. Create error recovery decorators\\n4. Test each error handling strategy\\n5. Integrate with existing system\\n\\n## Challenges Identified\\n- Agent lacks direct code writing permission\\n- Need for manual implementation or specialized agent\\n- Complex error handling requires careful design"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01UTeNLhiH34BMSsAfJ5fFt5', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'code_writer', 'input_data': {'task': 'Implement error handler infrastructure for Executive Director agent', 'specifications': {'base_directory': 'src/field/ensemble_ui/backend/agents/executive_director/', 'implementation_files': [{'path': 'error_handler.py', 'purpose': 'Core error handling mechanisms with retry logic and circuit breaker'}, {'path': 'validators.py', 'purpose': 'Input validation decorators and utility functions'}, {'path': 'error_logger.py', 'purpose': 'Specialized logging for error tracking and analysis'}], 'error_types_to_handle': ['BadRequestError', 'NotFoundError', 'CircuitBreakerOpenError', 'RateLimitError'], 'features_required': ['Exponential backoff retry mechanism', 'Circuit breaker pattern implementation', 'Input validation decorators', 'Contextual error logging', 'Graceful degradation strategies']}, 'config_file_path': 'output/error_handling_config.json', 'documentation_reference': 'output/error_handler_implementation_plan.md'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01UTeNLhiH34BMSsAfJ5fFt5', 'content': '{"success": false, "error": "Unknown agent type: code_writer. Agent definition file not found."}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01Apu5U7k6LG6cja8o2jdpC8', 'name': 'run_command', 'input': {'command': 'find . -name "*.json" | grep -i agent | head -10'}}]}, {'role': 'use